message.content:
{
  "answer_markdown": "To enable **automatic user joining** and **sign-in without separate password credentials**, the following plans and requirements apply:\n\n### **1. Automatic User Joining (Email Domain Authentication)**\n- **Supported plans**: Team and above [1].\n- **Mechanism**: Users with verified domain emails can join automatically via [Join Organization](https://admin.mistral.ai/join) [1].\n- **Credentials**: Users still **create and manage their own email/password credentials** (this feature only controls Organization membership, not authentication) [1].\n- **Verified domain requirement**: A **verified domain** is mandatory before enabling this feature [1][5]. Domain verification uses a **DNS TXT record** [1][5].\n\nTo enable:\n```\n1. Open **Admin Panel > Administration > Access** [1].\n2. In the **Domain Ownership** section, find the verified domain.\n3. Turn on **Discoverable** for that domain [1].\n```\n\n### **2. Sign-In Without Separate Passwords (SSO)**\n- **Supported plans**: **Enterprise only** [7].\n- **Mechanism**: Users sign in using **corporate credentials** (e.g., Okta, Azure AD) via **SAML SSO** [7]. No separate Mistral password is required.\n- **Verified domain requirement**: A **verified domain** is mandatory [7][5].\n\nTo enable:\n```\n1. Verify your domain (DNS TXT record) [5].\n2. Configure SAML SSO in the **Admin Panel** by pasting IdP metadata XML [8].\n3. Enable SSO [8].\n```\n\n### **Key Differences**\n- **Email domain auth (Team+)** allows **automatic joining** but **not passwordless sign-in** [1].\n- **SSO (Enterprise)** enables **passwordless sign-in** via corporate IdP [7].\n\n### **Prerequisites for Both**\n- A **verified domain** (DNS TXT record) is required for both features [1][5][7].",
  "citations": [
    {
      "n": 1,
      "quote": "Email domain authentication, also called discoverable domain authentication, controls how users join your Organization."
    },
    {
      "n": 1,
      "quote": "Users still **create and manage their own credentials** (email and password)."
    },
    {
      "n": 1,
      "quote": "You need to **verify ownership of your domain** before enabling this feature."
    },
    {
      "n": 1,
      "quote": "Email domain authentication is available on Team plans and above."
    },
    {
      "n": 5,
      "quote": "Domain verification proves that you control one or more email domains."
    },
    {
      "n": 7,
      "quote": "SAML single sign-on (SSO) lets members of your Organization **sign in with your corporate identity provider** (IdP)."
    },
    {
      "n": 7,
      "quote": "You need an Enterprise plan to configure SAML SSO."
    },
    {
      "n": 7,
      "quote": "at least one [verified domain](https://docs.mistral.ai/admin/set-up-organization/verify-domain);"
    },
    {
      "n": 8,
      "quote": "Paste the complete metadata XML into the text box in the Mistral SSO configuration modal."
    }
  ],
  "insufficient_evidence": false
}

