    },
    {
      "n": 11,
      "quote": "The SDK fetches the existing run and identifies records with status `\"error\"` (failed generation or scoring)."
    },
    {
      "n": 12,
      "quote": "After all records have been processed and scored. If any record fails, the run evaluator still runs on the successfully processed records."
